WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.243
Har customer ko baar baar photo aur price

00:00:03.243 --> 00:00:06.126
bhejte hain? Chaliye, aapki shop ka apna

00:00:06.126 --> 00:00:07.992
online store banate hain.

00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:11.542
Pehle site map. Home se Products, Delivery

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:14.484
aur Contact page tak ka raasta tay karte

00:00:14.484 --> 00:00:18.586
hain. Map se customer ko shop ki location bhi milti hai.

00:00:18.926 --> 00:00:21.836
Ab catalogue mein saaf product photos,

00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:24.834
price aur stock ki jaankari daalte hain.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:28.008
Customer apne phone par bhi dekh sakta hai.

00:00:28.348 --> 00:00:31.217
Customer item cart mein daalta hai. Phir

00:00:31.217 --> 00:00:34.172
checkout mein apni details bhar kar order

00:00:34.172 --> 00:00:35.522
confirm karta hai.

00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:38.975
Order aate hi shop ko item aur delivery ki

00:00:38.975 --> 00:00:41.996
details milti hain. Ab bas saamaan pack

00:00:41.996 --> 00:00:43.370
karke bhejna hai.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.543
Business website, online shop ya product

00:00:46.543 --> 00:00:49.457
listings chahiye? Neeche contact karein.

00:00:49.457 --> 00:00:51.480
Batayein aap kya bechte hain.
